 note='p7249M13mp18 triskelion has three28HBhoneycomb arms connected by3HBbridges. SI3/22–23 explicitly defines92bp flat versus84bp curved bridges,18common bridge strands and6specific strands per curvature. Main loosely calls these arm lengths; SI identifies bridges. Scaffold reservoir loops differ30/29bases(flat) versus38/37(curved). Convex/concave curved conformations are observations of one programmed curved design, not automatically distinct sequence variants. Six dimerization staples link arm1toarm1 during folding;12polymerization staples later link arms2/3 with6ntsticky ends.2nt/4ntsticky-end trials and6Tinterface controls are separate variants requiring source reconciliation. Nine cholesterol handles and6dye handles bind separate conjugates, not covalently modified core staples. Full common/core/vertex/interface replacement composition and native routing remain unverified. Movies described but not acquired/reviewed in this pass.'
