 b=next(b for b in L.read('batches') if b['batch_id']==rid);b['completed_actions'].append('Reviewed7of25: Turberfield triskelia main/SI,flat/curved bridge source pools and separate dimer/network connections.40main+3SIreferences saved; full sequence/movie audit pending.')
